== Luke (1-1.5 min)
Background of the game
- Stray takes place in an enclosed city
- All humans appear to have disappeared
- Robots, known as companions, have taken the role of humanity
- Robots mimic the behavior of humans, even in unnecessary ways

Introduce main argument
- themes of robots representing humanity as there culture develops in unique ways
- the central focus of our project is the diegetic music, which communicates the musical culture of the robots
  - diegetic = characters in the game can hear it
- musical culture of the robots communicates human and non-human elements

